timestamp=2026-11-09T11:29:59.200Z level=INFO run=195d671c message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="cat > /app/utils.py << 'PY'\nimport pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef parse_numeric(s):\n    if s is None:\n        return np.nan\n    if isinstance(s, (int, float)) and not isinstance(s, bool):\n        if pd.isna(s):\n            return np.nan\n        return float(s)\n    s = str(s).strip()\n    s_lower = s.lower()\n    if s_lower in ('timeout', 'err', 'error', 'na', 'n/a', 'none', 'null', '--', ''):\n        return np.nan\n    if s.count(',') == 1 and s.count('.') == 0:\n        s = s.replace(',', '.')\n    elif s.count(',') > 0 and s.count('.') > 0:\n        if s.rfind(',') > s.rfind('.'):\n            s = s.replace('.', '').replace(',', '.')\n        else:\n            s = s.replace(',', '')\n    elif s.count(',') > 0 and s.count('.') == 0:\n        s = s.replace(',', '')\n    try:\n        return float(s)\n    except:\n        return np.nan\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
